{
  "_comment": "The kinds of file a project of this core holds; Chimera's New Project window is built from it. A ColecoVision project is one cartridge. An ADAM project is any of a cartridge, two disks and two data packs: a cartridge alone starts the ADAM as a game, anything in a drive (or nothing at all) starts it as a computer, whose SmartWriter ROM boots what the drives hold. Only the chosen machine's slots are shown.",
